	passed it will be adjusted to the scaling parameters.
	Usage: SET_HEATER_SCALING [HEATER=<heater>] [SCALE=<scale_factor>]
	[BUMP=<degrees>] [MAXIMUM=<degrees>]
	[MINIMUM=<degrees>] [TARGET=<temp>]
variable_scaled_heaters = {}
