description = Loads filament to the extruder.
	Usage: LOAD_FILAMENT [LENGTH=<distance>] [SPEED=<speed>]
	[EXTRUDER=<extruder>] [MINIMUM=<temperature>]
	[BEEPS=<beep count on completion>]
